        "row_stretch": "default",
        "code": "<section class=\"ff-contact-section\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n\n    <!-- Hero -->\n    <div class=\"contact-hero\">\n      \n      <p>\n        If you are looking to come visit the farm, or are looking to place orders for quarter, half, full cows, or have a request for a special order, or any questions regarding an order you placed- please email us at: </p>\n<h2>wearefreedomfarms@gmail.com</h2>\n\n<p>*due to our order volume, it is difficult to reach out to every customer with updates on your order- so if you have not received your order in 14-days, please reach out.</p>\n\n<p>PLEASE DO NOT SHOW UP TO THE FARM WITHOUT AN APPOINTMENT. FARM TOURS BEGIN AGAIN IN JUNE.</p>\n<br>\n<br>\n   <p><strong>Farm Location: 237 OTT RD. GREENE, NY 13778</strong></p>\n<p><strong>We do not do tours or pickups on Sundays. All tours must be scheduled.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Questions regarding your order? Email is fastest- but you can also call us at:</strong></p>\n<h2>607-444-1396</h2>\n<p>We look forward to meeting and having you up at the farm as our guests!</p>\n<p>Stay Free.  Let's Make Meat Great Again. 🇺🇸</p>\n<h2>The Cavalea Family </h2>\n  </div>\n\n    <!-- Quick Actions -->\n    <div style=\"display:none\" class=\"quick-actions\">\n      <div class=\"action-card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\">🐄</div>\n        <h3>Schedule a Farm Visit</h3>\n        <p>\n          Experience the farm firsthand. Visits and tours are available by\n          appointment only.\n        </p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Farm Tours Begin in June</li>\n          <li>Scheduled Pickup Visits</li>\n          <li>Family Friendly Experience</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-primary\">Schedule a Visit</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"action-card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\">📦</div>\n        <h3>Bulk Meat Orders</h3>\n        <p>\n          Stock your freezer with premium farm-raised meats available in\n          multiple package options.\n        </p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Quarter Cow</li>\n          <li>Half Cow</li>\n          <li>Whole Cow</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-primary\">Request a Quote</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"action-card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\">🛒</div>\n        <h3>Order Support</h3>\n        <p>\n          Have a question about your order? We're happy to help.\n        </p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Shipping Assistance</li>\n          <li>Order Tracking</li>\n          <li>Delivery Questions</li>\n        </ul>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-primary\">Get Support</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n\n   \n\n  \n\n    \n\n    <!-- Closing -->\n    <div class=\"closing-banner\">\n      <h2>Direct From Our Farm To Your Family</h2>\n      <p>\n        Supporting local agriculture, ethical farming, and premium quality meat.\n      </p>\n      <span>— The Cavalea Family</span>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n.main-header {\n    \n    margin-bottom: 0;\n}\n.ff-contact-section {\n  padding: 80px 20px;\n  background: #faf8f4;\n  font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif;\n  color: #2c2c2c;\n}\n\n.ff-contact-section .container {\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n/* Hero */\n\n.contact-hero {\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-bottom: 70px;\n}\n\n.contact-hero .eyebrow {\n  display: inline-block;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #8d6e45;\n  margin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n\n.contact-hero h1 {\n  font-size: 52px;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n.contact-hero p {\n  max-width: 700px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n}\n\n/* Quick Actions */\n\n.quick-actions {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 30px;\n  margin-bottom: 80px;\n}\n\n.action-card {\n  background: #fff;\n  padding: 35px;\n  border-radius: 20px;\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\n  transition: .3s;\n}\n\n.action-card:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-5px);\n}\n\n.action-card .icon {\n  font-size: 40px;\n  margin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n\n.action-card h3 {\n  margin-bottom: 15px;\n  font-size: 24px;\n}\n\n.action-card p {\n  margin-bottom: 15px;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\n.action-card ul {\n  margin: 0 0 25px;\n  padding-left: 18px;\n}\n\n.action-card li {\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.btn-primary {\n  display: inline-block;\n  padding: 14px 28px;\n  background: #5f7a45;\n  color: #fff;\n  text-decoration: none;\n  border-radius: 50px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.btn-primary:hover {\n  background: #4d6537;\n}\n\n/* Contact Grid */\n\n.contact-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 25px;\n  margin-bottom: 70px;\n}\n\n.contact-card {\n  background: #fff;\n  padding: 35px;\n  border-radius: 20px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.contact-card h2 {\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.contact-link {\n  color: #5f7a45;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-decoration: none;\n}\n\n/* Banner */\n\n.appointment-banner {\n  background: #5f7a45;\n  color: #fff;\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 60px 40px;\n  border-radius: 24px;\n  margin-bottom: 80px;\n}\n\n.appointment-banner h2 {\n  margin-bottom: 15px;\n  font-size: 34px;\n}\n\n.appointment-banner p {\n  max-width: 700px;\n  margin: auto;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n}\n\n/* FAQ */\n\n.section-heading {\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-bottom: 40px;\n}\n\n.section-heading h2 {\n  font-size: 40px;\n}\n\n.faq-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n  gap: 25px;\n  margin-bottom: 80px;\n}\n\n.faq-item {\n  background: #fff;\n  padding: 30px;\n  border-radius: 18px;\n}\n\n.faq-item h4 {\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n  font-size: 20px;\n}\n\n/* Newsletter */\n\n.newsletter-box {\n  background: #fff;\n  padding: 60px;\n  border-radius: 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-bottom: 80px;\n}\n\n.newsletter-box h2 {\n  margin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n\n.newsletter-form {\n  margin-top: 25px;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.newsletter-form input {\n  width: 350px;\n  padding: 15px 20px;\n  border: 1px solid #ddd;\n  border-radius: 50px;\n}\n\n.newsletter-form button {\n  padding: 15px 30px;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 50px;\n  background: #5f7a45;\n  color: #fff;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n/* Closing */\n\n.closing-banner {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 40px 20px;\n}\n\n.closing-banner h2 {\n  font-size: 42px;\n  margin-bottom: 15px;\n}\n\n.closing-banner p {\n  max-width: 650px;\n  margin: 0 auto 15px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n}\n\n.closing-banner span {\n  font-style: italic;\n  color: #777;\n}\n\n/* Responsive */\n\n@media (max-width: 992px) {\n\n  .quick-actions,\n  .contact-grid,\n  .faq-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n\n  .contact-hero h1 {\n    font-size: 40px;\n  }\n\n  .newsletter-form {\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n  .newsletter-form input {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 500px;\n  }\n}\n</style>",
